<title>JAPAN: Tonen Corp to shut 130,000 bpd topper from Oct 1.</title>
<headline>Tonen Corp to shut 130,000 bpd topper from Oct 1.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japanese refiner Tonen Corp said on Thursday it plans to close its 130,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit (CDU) at its Wakayama plant, in western Japan, from October 1 to early November for routine maintenance checks.  </p>
<p>Besides Tonen, eight oil firms are planning to carry out scheduled turnarounds at their plants in October.</p>
</text>
